law.text:
		The Director shall make, adopt and promulgate regulations governing the following aspects of private management and operation of prison facilities approved by the General Assembly pursuant to § 53.1-265:

Contingency plans for state operation of a contractor-operated facility in the event of a termination of the contract;


Use of deadly and nondeadly force by prison contractors' security personnel;


Methods of monitoring a contractor-operated facility by the Department;


Public access to a contractor-operated facility; and


Such other regulations as may be necessary to carry out the provisions of this chapter.
